{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-105905","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171034","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-105906","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171035","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-171036","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-171037","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-171038","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-171039","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-171040","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-105907","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171041","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-105908","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171042","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-171043","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-171044","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-105909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171045","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-171046","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-105910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171047","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-171048","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-171049","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-105911","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-105912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171050","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-105913","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171051","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-105914","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-105915","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171052","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-105916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171053","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-171054","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-171055","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-105917","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-105918","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171056","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-105919","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171057","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-105920","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171058","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-171059","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-171060","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-171061","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-105921","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-105923","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171062","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-171063","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-105924","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105927","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171064","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-105926","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105929","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171065","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-171066","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-171067","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-105928","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105931","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171068","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-171069","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-171070","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-105930","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105933","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171071","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-171072","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-171073","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-105932","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105935","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171074","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-171075","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-171076","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-105934","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105937","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171077","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-171078","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-171079","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-105936","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105939","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171080","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-171081","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-171082","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-105938","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105941","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171083","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-171084","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-171085","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-171086","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-171087","marks":["code"],"text":"{:block, reason, state}"}]}],"id":"blk-105940","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105943","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171088","text":"Tracks violations as audit entries"}]}],"id":"blk-105942","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105945","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171089","text":"Wraps MCP tool dispatch — called before every tool invocation"}]}],"id":"blk-105944","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-105946","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105948","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171090","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement the two enforced pipelines"},{"id":"spn-171091","text":" (section 3)"}]}],"id":"blk-105947","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-105949","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105951","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171092","text":"Reactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-171093","marks":["code"],"text":"query |> recall |> topology |> deliberate(if κ>0) |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-105950","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105953","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171094","text":"Proactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-171095","marks":["code"],"text":"heartbeat |> survey |> triage |> dispatch |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-105952","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105955","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171096","text":"Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3) — 10 routing rules"}]}],"id":"blk-105954","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-105956","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171097","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integration with OS-006"},{"id":"spn-171098","text":" (section 5.3)"}]}],"id":"blk-105957","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-105959","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-105961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171099","text":"OS-008 Pipelin